# a preset pack (tools/loom_presets.py: USER_PUT messages, app/samples.c) sent in: each preset into its slot, saved at
# once. tests/fixtures/presetpack.syx: U3 a pad (presets format 18: cutoff 40, a delay at 124, 1/4D); U4 a format 17
# preset, from before 1/4D, its delay at 127 (1/4 then): made one now, 121; U5 in format 99, newer than this LOOM-8:
# refused (rc 9), U5 stays empty
wait 300
sysexfile tests/fixtures/presetpack.syx
preset 4 U3
expect par4.cut 40
expect par4.itype 16
expect par4.i1 124
preset 5 U4
expect par5.itype 16
expect par5.i1 121
# kept through a restart (saved to the flash)
reboot
wait 400
preset 6 U3
expect par6.cut 40
# 64 user presets (presets format 19: 32 an object of their own, OBJ_UP0 and OBJ_UP1): U40 and U64 saved, kept through a
# restart; a backup (version 2) holds them: changed, restored, back
param 2 cut 77
usersave 2 40
param 2 cut 33
usersave 2 64
reboot
wait 400
preset 3 U40
expect par3.cut 77
preset 3 U64
expect par3.cut 33
backup out:up64.bkp
param 2 cut 5
usersave 2 64
restore out:up64.bkp
expect restore_rc 0
wait 300
preset 3 U64
expect par3.cut 33
